{
  "sections": [
    {
      "id": "guidelines",
      "title_zh": "课堂纪律",
      "title_en": "Class Guidelines",
      "source_zh": "编辑后的讲义 Blackjack Training",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "上课要守时、得体、参与。在 YBR 或 PPC 上课、人在钟点上，不能打老虎机。手机留到休息。烟只在指定员工区，不要在客人看得到的地方。"
        },
        {
          "type": "quote",
          "en": "When on property for class at YBR or PPC, dealer school students may not play slot machines while on the clock.",
          "zh": "在 YBR 或 PPC 上课、在钟点内，不能打老虎机。"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "其余几条：尊重别人；准时；按形象规定着装；定目标；参加课堂活动；有问题就问；毒品和酒精不能带进物业。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "policies",
      "title_zh": "总政策",
      "title_en": "General Policies",
      "source_zh": "编辑后的讲义 Blackjack Training",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "quote",
          "en": "Never argue with a guest.",
          "zh": "永远不要跟客人争。"
        },
        {
          "type": "quote",
          "en": "You are never to correct your own mistakes. Call a supervisor for all corrections and problems.",
          "zh": "自己的错自己改，是不允许的。改正和出问题都叫主管。"
        },
        {
          "type": "quote",
          "en": "Exhibit an impartial position concerning the outcome of a hand.",
          "zh": "对这一手的输赢保持中立。"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "客人问规则可以解释，不要教他怎么下注、怎么打。楼面主管在特殊情况下可以让荷官偏离一般政策。附近有异常，马上告诉主管。"
        },
        {
          "type": "quote",
          "en": "Cross firing is not permitted. Conversation between dealers during a live game is not permitted unless it concerns the transfer of information pertinent to the game.",
          "zh": "禁止 cross firing。直播时荷官之间不能闲聊，除非是这局要交接的信息。"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "喊 change、color up 等，声音要清楚，让主管听得见。讲义原文写的是 on or near you game，按印出的句子保留。"
        },
        {
          "type": "calls",
          "audio_ids": [
            "d-never-argue",
            "d-supervisor",
            "d-floor",
            "d-ask-supervisor"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "guest",
      "title_zh": "客人服务",
      "title_en": "Guest Service",
      "source_zh": "编辑后的讲义 Blackjack Training",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "客人上来和离开都要口头招呼，有眼神和微笑。买筹时说 good luck。离开时说谢谢。聊天是工作的一部分，但不能影响节奏和发牌准确。"
        },
        {
          "type": "quote",
          "en": "Conversation with players is encouraged and is part of your duties.",
          "zh": "鼓励和客人交谈，这是职责的一部分。"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "语气、用词、表情和身体语言都在被观察。要对场地和正在举行的活动有所了解。"
        },
        {
          "type": "calls",
          "audio_ids": [
            "d-good-luck",
            "d-thank-you"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "terminology",
      "title_zh": "荷官术语",
      "title_en": "Blackjack Terminology",
      "source_zh": "编辑后的讲义 Blackjack Training",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "quote",
          "en": "Change $100",
          "zh": "现金换筹。切出筹码后喊出来。$100 及以上等批准。"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "讲义例子：客人交一张 $100 钞票要筹码。荷官切出 $100 筹码，说 Change $100，然后等批准。"
        },
        {
          "type": "quote",
          "en": "Cheque change $100",
          "zh": "大筹换小筹。大筹放工作区左边，小筹在右边切出。$100 及以上等批准。"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "讲义例子：客人交 $100 绿筹，要换成红筹。"
        },
        {
          "type": "quote",
          "en": "Cheques Play",
          "zh": "客人下注 $100 或以上。喊完再继续发牌。"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "黑筹、紫筹或橙筹下注，喊 Black Action、Purple Action 或 Orange Action，然后继续。"
        },
        {
          "type": "quote",
          "en": "Color Coming In",
          "zh": "客人要换成更大面额再离开。先喊，等批准，才能把筹码拿进来。"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "拿进来以后，左边拆客人的筹码，右边切出要换成的金额，再喊 Color up 加金额，再等楼面主管批准。"
        },
        {
          "type": "calls",
          "audio_ids": [
            "d-change-100",
            "d-cheque-change-100",
            "d-cheques-play",
            "d-black-action",
            "d-purple-action",
            "d-orange-action",
            "d-color-coming",
            "d-color-up-100"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "cheques",
      "title_zh": "筹码颜色",
      "title_en": "Breaking Down Cheques",
      "source_zh": "编辑后的讲义 Blackjack Training",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "一摞标准 20 张。粉、绿、紫、灰按 4 拆。白、红、黑、橙按 5 拆。"
        },
        {
          "type": "table",
          "headers": [
            "颜色",
            "面额",
            "20 张",
            "拆法"
          ],
          "rows": [
            [
              "白 White",
              "$1",
              "$20",
              "5"
            ],
            [
