              "4"
            ]
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "橙，讲义上带星号：1 and 1, stack, size in, drop 1, stack。灰，也带星号：1 and 1, stack and size in。按印出的手法做。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "rundown",
      "title_zh": "切筹口诀",
      "title_en": "Cheque Rundown",
      "source_zh": "编辑后的讲义 Blackjack Training",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "白、红、黑、橙，按 5：5=5，6=3-3，7=3-3-1，8=4-4，9=4-4-1，10=5-5。"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "粉、绿、紫，按 4：5=4-1，6=3-3，7=3-3-1，8=4-4，9=4-4-1，10=4-4-2。5 张绿是 4-1，不是一摞 5。"
        },
        {
          "type": "callout",
          "tone": "gap",
          "text": "这页没有印灰筹的 1 到 10 切法。灰只在 Breaking Down Cheques 里写明按 4 拆。不要自己补一张灰的口诀表。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "insurance",
      "title_zh": "保险",
      "title_en": "Insurance",
      "source_zh": "编辑后的讲义 Blackjack Training",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "quote",
          "en": "After the dealer settles any Match the Dealer or Kings Bounty side bets, the dealer will announce “Insurance Open” in a clear voice and with a hand motion along the insurance line.",
          "zh": "先结两个边注，再清楚喊 Insurance Open，并沿保险线做手势。"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "只有荷官第一张是 A 才开。保险赢：荷官是 blackjack。否则保险输。客人放在保险线上的注，等于原注的一半或更少。客人自己有 blackjack，可以选择 even money。"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "讲义这张表印的是满额保险要下多少，没有另印赔付列。"
        },
